  "abstract": "Comprehensive kill-test of Energy-Flow Cosmology (EFC) versus \u039bCDM across six probes from galaxy rotation curves to CMB, BAO, and SNe. Using a single action with two global field parameters (K0, m^2), EFC jointly predicts \u03bc\u22480.94 and \u03a3\u22481.05 from one mechanism (stiffness + slip) and achieves \u0394\u03c7^2 \u2264 0 across four cobaya minimize runs. The results indicate EFC cannot be rejected by current data; full MCMC with Bayes evidence is identified as the remaining decisive test.",
